sequenceDiagram
    actor AdminStaff as Admin/Staff
    participant Page as OrderListPage
    participant Controller as OrderRestController
    participant Service as OrderService
    participant OrderRepo as OrderRepository
    participant StatusRepo as OrderStatusRepository
    participant DB as Database

    AdminStaff->>Page: Click the "Approve" button
    activate Page

    Page->>Controller: Send approve order request
    activate Controller
    Note right of Controller: The request asks the system to approve the order

    Controller->>Service: Ask service to update order status
    activate Service

    Service->>OrderRepo: Get the order information
    activate OrderRepo
    OrderRepo->>DB: Search for the order in database
    DB-->>OrderRepo: Send back order data
    OrderRepo-->>Service: Return the order
    deactivate OrderRepo

    Service->>StatusRepo: Get the Processing status
    activate StatusRepo
    StatusRepo->>DB: Search for Processing status in database
    DB-->>StatusRepo: Send back Processing status
    StatusRepo-->>Service: Return the Processing status
    deactivate StatusRepo

    Note over Service: Change order status to Processing

    Service->>OrderRepo: Save the updated order
    activate OrderRepo
    OrderRepo->>DB: Update order status in database
    DB-->>OrderRepo: Confirm the update result
    OrderRepo-->>Service: Return the updated order
    deactivate OrderRepo

    Service-->>Controller: Tell controller the order was approved
    deactivate Service

    Controller-->>Page: Send success response to the page
    deactivate Controller

    Page-->>AdminStaff: Show that the order is approved
    deactivate Page
